6. Statutory rights. Nothing in this licence restricts any use permitted by applicable
   law without the copyright holder's permission.

7. No warranty. The licensed materials are provided as they are, without warranty of
   any kind. The manuscript states what the proofs establish and what they do not;
   nothing in this licence extends those statements.

8. Termination. Your rights under this licence end automatically if you breach it, and
   revive if you cure the breach within thirty days of becoming aware of it. Published
   results already released are unaffected.

9. Other uses. For any use this licence does not permit, ask the copyright holder
   through the repository.
